ertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}interior\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3InteriorPoint}_S(X,\\tau,A,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\nA\\subseteq X\\land x\\in A\\land\n\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq A)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}interior\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3InteriorPoint}_S(X,\\tau,A,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\nA\\subseteq X\\land x\\in A\\land\n\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq A)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$（参数顺序为 $(X,\\tau)$，see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,x,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3InteriorPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}interior\\text{-}point} 